The NanoPi R2S uses the RK3328 SoC. It has two Gbps Ethernet ports and 1G DDR4 RAM. It is a good device for developing IoT applications, NAS applications etc.

{{media:friendlyarm:nanopi-r2s-openwrt.png?400|nanopi-r2s}}


**Support Forums** https://forum.openwrt.org/t/nanopi-r2s-have-performance-issue/220268
